      en: ["Most important ridge in the otherwise flat north of Belize.", "Consists primarily of Tertiary limestone.", "Functions as a central watershed for the Orange Walk District.", "Houses important habitats for pumas and tropical birds.", "Site of numerous undiscovered archaeological Maya sites.", "Characterized by dense, seasonally dry tropical forest.", "Important corridor for wildlife exchange in the north.", "Offers spectacular views over the vast plains as far as Mexico."]
