      en: ["Elevations in the watershed of the Deep River Forest Reserve.", "Unique mosaic of rainforest and pine savanna.", "Important retreat for wildlife during the rainy season.", "Low human impact guarantees high biological integrity.", "Provide important nesting sites for birds of prey.", "Geologically diverse through mixture of limestone and sediments.", "Strategically located in the biological corridor of the south.", "Provide orientation in the flat coastal plain of Toledo."]
