      en: ["Center of Belize's national citrus production.", "Wide, fertile valley between mountains and sea.", "Traversed by the scenically attractive Hummingbird Highway.", "Most important economic engine of the Stann Creek District.", "Characterized by rich alluvial soils and constant water flow.", "Provides panoramic views of the Cockscomb Range.", "Historically significant region for railway development in Belize.", "Central settlement area for Garifuna and Mestizo communities."]
